Subject: [PATCH 21/31] ARM: dts: r8a7745: add Ether support
Date: Thu, 17 Nov 2016 15:11:38 +0100
Message-Id: <687ccbc67288577d4187cdad7435c27251ecedb7.1479391750.git.horms+renesas@verge.net.au>
In-Reply-To: <cover.1479391750.git.horms+renesas@verge.net.au>
